{"id":"wb-8-281","name":"湖州潮音桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"潮音橋","text":"潮音桥为位于中国浙江省湖州市吴兴区朝阳街道南街中段、原湖州府城南门定安门内的一座三孔石拱桥，东西向跨霅溪，始建于明嘉靖十八年（1539），万历三十三年（1605）重建。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BD%AE%E9%9F%B3%E6%A9%8B","revisionId":92157293,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92157293","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cf9e3b4d81640034181d5861.jpg","title":"Chaoyin_Bridge_05_2014-04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chaoyin_Bridge_05_2014-04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bb/Chaoyin_Bridge_05_2014-04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​潮音桥，自南侧看桥底。","width":320,"height":240}}